# Inkling-2-Mini on TWO gfx1030 cards (V620, 29.98 GiB each), TP=2, with DSpark speculative
# decoding: the model's own draft (mtp.safetensors, which has to sit in the checkpoint directory)
# proposes 7 tokens per step and the engine verifies 2 of them. Everything else is
# inkling2-mini-tp2: FULL_AND_PIECEWISE HIP graphs, the one-shot HIP all-reduce inside them, prefix
# caching, one image per prompt. Draft, kernels, measured tables and the equality with the no-draft
# output: docs/rdna2/inkling2-dspark.md.
#
#   bash tools/rdna/serve_rdna.sh RECIPE=inkling2-mini-tp2-dspark MODEL=/path/to/inkling2-mini \
#     VENV=/path/to/venv HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=4,5
#
# Override any key after RECIPE= or in the caller's environment (both win over this file and over
# inkling2-mini-tp2), e.g. SEQS=8 SPEC_CONFIG='...[[1,2,2],[3,8,0]]...' keeps the draft for one or
# two requests and drops it from three.
#
# Decode ms per token of one request, no draft -> K = 2 (3 prompts of each kind of text, 160
# tokens, greedy): chat 12.4 -> 10.8 (1.15x), prose 1.17x, code 1.28x, structured 1.45x, edits of
# a file 1.54x, questions on a given document 1.62x; the mean of the six 12.5 -> 9.3 (1.35x).
# Two requests at once (chat, an earlier build): 16.2 -> 14.2 (1.14x). The draft does not leave
# the full context its room: its full-attention layer keeps K/V on every rank (4 KiB per token,
# 4.05 GiB at 1,048,576 tokens) and its weights (0.8 GiB) and graphs come on top, so a
# 1,048,576-token request needs 20.18 GiB against the 16.14 GiB the engine has. The longest
# context is about 790,000 tokens at SEQS 2 (MAXLEN 780000 below: 790,241 tokens of KV) and
# 737,088 at SEQS 8; the 1,048,576-token recipes stay without it.
# The model requires num_speculative_tokens 7 (the draft block is 8 rows); the schedule [[1,2,2]]
# is the number of those 7 the engine verifies per step for 1..2 requests.

# shellcheck source=tools/rdna/recipes/inkling2-mini-tp2.env
source "$RDSE_RECIPES/inkling2-mini-tp2.env"

SEQS=2
MAXLEN=780000
SPEC_CONFIG='{"method":"dspark","num_speculative_tokens":7,"num_speculative_tokens_per_batch_size":[[1,2,2]]}'
